#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:3
#: 26a1953646f145708ef049704351dd09
msgid "表面薄层扫描（Surface Slab Scan）"
msgstr "Surface Slab Scan"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:5
#: b70184b5ff4d4d4e8186a92f7a11f0d3
msgid "**分类：** 表面"
msgstr "**Category:** Surface"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:7
#: 1131cbfacccb409981897228ac863e53
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:9
#: 9329518b9058400c85173436197bcd6d
msgid ""
"从三维周期体相结构按明确的 Miller 晶面列表切出 "
"slab，并扫描法向重复数与单侧真空厚度。它是确定性枚举：相同输入和参数会得到相同顺序的输出。"
msgstr ""
"Cut slabs from a three-dimensionally periodic bulk structure using an "
"explicit list of Miller planes, while scanning the number of repeats "
"along the surface normal and the one-sided vacuum thickness. This is a "
"deterministic enumeration: identical inputs and parameters produce "
"outputs in the same order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:11
#: ec2af78a40a84ff5acfa985d3d64a18e
msgid ""
"Miller 指数 $(h,k,l)$ 使用**输入晶胞的倒易基矢**解释。若你希望 `(100)`、`(110)`、`(111)` "
"具有常规晶体学含义，请输入对应的常规晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"The Miller index $(h,k,l)$ is interpreted in the **reciprocal basis of "
"the input cell**. If `(100)`, `(110)`, and `(111)` should carry their "
"conventional crystallographic meanings, provide the corresponding "
"conventional cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:13
#: 6b9550bd32684a84ad3a392f5d1d49c6
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:15
#: c98a297c438743848d6313c1605a8eb5
msgid "界面中的每一行表示一个晶面。程序先用"
msgstr ""
"Each row in the interface represents one crystallographic plane. The "
"program first uses"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:17
#: 475d079f9ab94221bea1c5a45762adca
msgid ""
"\n"
"g=\\gcd(|h|,|k|,|l|),\\qquad (h,k,l)\\rightarrow(h/g,k/g,l/g)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:21
#: 36fe5f54821c4c44bcec82355e10e618
msgid "约简比例相同的指数，再按约简结果去重；例如 `(002)` 会并入 `(001)`，但 `(00-1)` 保留为另一取向。"
msgstr ""
"to reduce proportionally equivalent indices, then removes duplicates "
"based on the reduced result. For example, `(002)` is merged into `(001)`,"
" whereas `(00-1)` is retained as the opposite orientation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:23
#: c8746b708aa740e193b12301edf43f3a
msgid ""
"对每个晶面、法向重复数 $r$ 和单侧真空 $v$ 调用 ASE `surface`。若输入有 $N$ 个原子，该组合得到 $Nr$ "
"个原子。真空会同时加在 slab 上下两侧，因此总真空间隔增加 $2v$。"
msgstr ""
"For every plane, normal repeat count $r$, and one-sided vacuum value $v$,"
" the program calls ASE `surface`. An input containing $N$ atoms gives "
"$Nr$ atoms for that combination. Vacuum is added above and below the "
"slab, so the total vacuum separation increases by $2v$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:25
#: 8dac23c906d240ad810b963f01efbb00
msgid ""
"输出会重新定向，使表面法向沿笛卡尔 $z$，第一条面内晶格矢量沿 $x$，第二条位于 $xy$ 平面。每组参数只生成一种由输入晶胞原点决定的 "
"termination；若需要比较不同 termination，应准备具有不同原点/切分位置的体相输入。"
msgstr ""
"The output is reoriented so that the surface normal lies along Cartesian "
"$z$, the first in-plane lattice vector lies along $x$, and the second "
"lies in the $xy$ plane. Each parameter combination produces only one "
"termination, determined by the origin of the input cell. To compare "
"different terminations, prepare bulk inputs with different origins or "
"cleavage positions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:27
#: 34573d9120ed412ea91ab29d71a82aa6
msgid "范围 `[start, stop, step]` 只取不超过 `stop` 的点，点数为"
msgstr ""
"A `[start, stop, step]` range includes only points that do not exceed "
"`stop`; the number of points is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:29
#: e6d4c26f2ece4090a258c8ef0ed4a000
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"n=1+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{stop-start}{step}\\right\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:33
#: 456fa49aa9464432ae8bcce2e4ab49bd
msgid "设约简去重后有 $n_h$ 个晶面、$n_r$ 个重复数和 $n_v$ 个真空值，则每个输入精确产生"
msgstr ""
"If reduction and deduplication leave $n_h$ planes, $n_r$ repeat counts, "
"and $n_v$ vacuum values, each input produces exactly"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:35
#: 5ceab7ee41bb4d5fbf1f285b9067effc
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{out}=n_hn_rn_v,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:39
#: d07648a622f3415083b3141797e6747d
msgid "总生成原子数为"
msgstr "The total number of generated atoms is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:41
#: 50aef5c1600947d18f7cb928c539b8cd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{atoms}=N\\,n_hn_v\\sum_r r.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:45
#: 9a34644a23c345d08bce4e13dfdbc01b
msgid "界面预览和运行前预算校验使用同一套公式，不会为了计数提前构造 slab。"
msgstr ""
"The interface preview and pre-run budget check use the same formulas; "
"slabs are not constructed early merely to count them."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:47
#: e24c7ae2d20245979a2d908a4d195f2c
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:49
#: a0ada718693744d2b08048732f8ede84
msgid "场景：模型对低指数表面的力误差明显高于体相"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: force errors on low-index surfaces are much larger than in the "
"bulk"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:51
#: 9147383e2a3640cb8f7c44ed45788275
msgid "训练集主要是体相结构，表面低配位环境覆盖不足。"
msgstr ""
"The training set consists mainly of bulk structures and does not "
"adequately cover undercoordinated surface environments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:53
#: 8d8f8f6eb1eb4333b1b9254b7b13d553
msgid "**输入：** 8 原子的常规 Si 晶胞，三方向均为周期边界。"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** An eight-atom conventional Si cell, periodic in all three "
"directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:55
#: 4fd2d6031b2e4178a2df805a2eb54653
msgid "**目标：** 覆盖 `(100)`、`(110)`、`(111)`，法向重复数 3–6，单侧真空 10 Å。"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Cover `(100)`, `(110)`, and `(111)`, with 3–6 repeats along the"
" normal and 10 Å of one-sided vacuum."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:57
#: b750c7bc44564c358177f2285e17de01
msgid ""
"**参数设置：** "
"`hkl_list=[[1,0,0],[1,1,0],[1,1,1]]`，`layer_range=[3,6,1]`，`vacuum_range=[10,10,1]`。"
msgstr ""
"**Parameters:** `hkl_list=[[1,0,0],[1,1,0],[1,1,1]]`, "
"`layer_range=[3,6,1]`, and `vacuum_range=[10,10,1]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:59
#: 634f5818f95a4f598905dde6ce0662bc
msgid "**输出：** 每个输入 12 个 slab，单个输出含 24–48 个原子，总计 432 个生成原子。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** 12 slabs per input, each containing 24–48 atoms, for 432 "
"generated atoms in total."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:61
#: 258eaea7d2344368b10f94f3e3040084
msgid ""
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 先检查输出的晶面、cell 和上下真空是否符合预期；标注并重训后，对独立的 "
"`(100)/(110)/(111)` 表面验证集分别比较能量和力误差。"
msgstr ""
"**How to verify that training-set quality improved:** First check that "
"the output planes, cells, and vacuum above and below each slab match the "
"intended setup. After labeling and retraining, compare energy and force "
"errors separately on independent `(100)`, `(110)`, and `(111)` surface "
"validation sets."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:63
#: eda23d8b6ddd4859b6e16bd8e2698298
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:65
#: 569a437498c6482d8b4be95d565faf13
msgid "晶面列表（hkl_list）"
msgstr "Plane List (hkl_list)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:67
#: 98b5126481154e14a98a42e15c624c90
msgid "嵌套整数列表，默认 `[[1,0,0],[1,1,0],[1,1,1]]`。每行直接填写一个 `(h,k,l)`；可用低指数预设起步，再增删行。"
msgstr ""
"Nested integer list, default `[[1,0,0],[1,1,0],[1,1,1]]`. Enter one "
"`(h,k,l)` plane per row. Start from the low-index preset, then add or "
"remove rows as needed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:69
#: 36c85119071a48fea2b6105035fe53bc
msgid "指数相对输入晶胞的倒易基矢。程序自动约简并去重比例相同的行，`(0,0,0)` 会明确报错。"
msgstr ""
"Indices are relative to the reciprocal basis of the input cell. The "
"program automatically reduces and deduplicates proportional rows, and "
"reports `(0,0,0)` as an explicit error."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:71
#: f76420191de54ea2accdec377771a391
msgid "法向等价重复范围（layer_range）"
msgstr "Normal Repeat Range (layer_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:73
#: 04811c328c70459795c7b13b506c86a5
msgid ""
"三个整数，默认 `[3,6,1]`，依次为起点、终点、步长。这里的 `r` 是 ASE 将定向后的体相单元沿表面法向重复的次数，因此输出原子数是 "
"$Nr$；它不保证等于肉眼数出的原子平面数。"
msgstr ""
"Three integers, default `[3,6,1]`, giving start, stop, and step. Here, "
"`r` is the number of times ASE repeats the oriented bulk unit along the "
"surface normal, so the output contains $Nr$ atoms. It is not guaranteed "
"to equal the number of atomic planes seen by eye."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:75
#: 40fb75a47b564477b075dfe798273f28
msgid "增加 `r` 会让 slab 更厚，也会线性增加单个输出的原子数。可用表面能或中心层局域环境随 `r` 的收敛情况选择范围。"
msgstr ""
"Increasing `r` makes the slab thicker and increases the atom count of "
"each output linearly. Choose the range by checking convergence of the "
"surface energy or the local environment in the central layers with "
"respect to `r`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:77
#: ec1004721b2d42339603c0b80133b6c6
msgid "单侧真空范围（vacuum_range）"
msgstr "One-Sided Vacuum Range (vacuum_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:79
#: d49f5afd780c4553bdb9521a51e7850e
msgid "三个浮点数，默认 `[10,10,1]`，单位 Å。每个值分别加在 slab 上、下两侧，总真空间隔增加两倍。"
msgstr ""
"Three floating-point values, default `[10,10,1]`, in Å. Each value is "
"added above and below the slab, so the total vacuum separation increases "
"by twice that value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:81
#: 68cf87b3a3434d6aba1807ed06992435
msgid "需要放置较高吸附物时可增大真空；是否足够应由体系尺寸和后续计算的真空收敛结果判断。"
msgstr ""
"Increase the vacuum when accommodating tall adsorbates. Whether it is "
"sufficient should be determined from the system dimensions and a vacuum-"
"convergence test for the subsequent calculation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:83
#: eb0bec901a77479e9c5fa3bb9b38ea38
msgid "法向周期边界（normal_pbc）"
msgstr "Periodic Boundary along Normal (normal_pbc)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:85
#: 0411c0427beb4abe9a1e0bf712da5baa
msgid "布尔值，默认 `true`。开启时输出三个方向均周期；关闭时只有面内周期，表面法向为非周期。"
msgstr ""
"Boolean, default `true`. When enabled, the output is periodic in all "
"three directions. When disabled, only the in-plane directions are "
"periodic and the surface normal is nonperiodic."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:87
#: c3d5fe4bed4f43be823ad3b46769f535
msgid "关闭时单侧真空必须大于 0，否则法向 cell 无法形成有效尺寸。"
msgstr ""
"When it is disabled, one-sided vacuum must be greater than zero; "
"otherwise the cell cannot acquire a valid size along the normal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:89
#: 840f2287311b45069ad36c2f8f25cf7f
msgid "每输入最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Maximum Outputs per Input (max_outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:91
#: 8fd857fefc3643c18daaa035d78d59bc
msgid "正整数，默认 200。若 $n_hn_rn_v$ 超过该值，运行会在构造第一个 slab 前停止并提示缩小扫描或主动提高上限。"
msgstr ""
"Positive integer, default 200. If $n_hn_rn_v$ exceeds this value, the run"
" stops before constructing the first slab and asks you to narrow the scan"
" or deliberately raise the limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:93
#: 93eae5d3532b4bf084595eb21196b2f9
msgid "每输入生成原子预算（max_generated_atoms）"
msgstr "Generated-Atom Budget per Input (max_generated_atoms)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:95
#: 36c73a250cba44ee962500c0ef73307b
msgid "正整数，默认 200000。它限制所有输出的原子数总和 $Nn_hn_v\\sum_r r$，用于避免一个大输入或宽扫描意外占满内存。"
msgstr ""
"Positive integer, default 200000. It limits the total atom count across "
"all outputs, $Nn_hn_v\\sum_r r$, preventing a large input or broad scan "
"from unexpectedly exhausting memory."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:97
#: 3ce0183751f7463ab3d2c56fcc5d246b
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:99
#: 5480d187372f495dbad35f09d499aca6
msgid "单个 `(111)` 收敛扫描"
msgstr "Single `(111)` Convergence Scan"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:101
#: d94ee38b2290477fa35813197d414951
msgid "用于只比较 slab 厚度是否收敛，共 6 个输出。"
msgstr ""
"Use this to examine slab-thickness convergence alone; it produces six "
"outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:103
#: 0dc05162e78b4f76a91f495c36df65c3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"hkl_list\": [[1, 1, 1]],\n"
"    \"layer_range\": [3, 8, 1],\n"
"    \"vacuum_range\": [12.0, 12.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"normal_pbc\": true,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 50,\n"
"    \"max_generated_atoms\": 100000\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:118
#: eec559c338aa487b801041492c567719
msgid "三个低指数面覆盖"
msgstr "Coverage of Three Low-Index Surfaces"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:120
#: 1be3b52faaa94c39befd24c693e3d149
msgid "用于同时补充 `(100)`、`(110)`、`(111)`，并比较 10 Å 与 15 Å 单侧真空，共 24 个输出。"
msgstr ""
"Use this to add `(100)`, `(110)`, and `(111)` together and compare 10 Å "
"with 15 Å of one-sided vacuum; it produces 24 outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:122
#: 3a1ea0defdf44c72b4fe47fa6e256f25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"hkl_list\": [[1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 0], [1, 1, 1]],\n"
"    \"layer_range\": [3, 6, 1],\n"
"    \"vacuum_range\": [10.0, 15.0, 5.0],\n"
"    \"normal_pbc\": true,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 100,\n"
"    \"max_generated_atoms\": 200000\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:137
#: c090d3588976426ba9f9817557d00bc9
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:139
#: 710dd37b9e7c4543bd999f54faa15cf8
msgid "`表面薄层扫描 → 插隙与吸附`：先切出目标晶面，再生成表面吸附候选。"
msgstr "`Surface Slab Scan → Interstitial & Adsorbate`: first cut the target surface, then generate candidate adsorption structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:140
#: 7f81027afeeb4d40b659071dfb5b2fa5
msgid "`表面薄层扫描 → 原子扰动`：在已确认正确的 slab 上加入小幅热扰动环境。"
msgstr "`Surface Slab Scan → Atomic Perturb`: add small thermal-like perturbations to slabs whose construction has already been verified."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:141
#: fa58486060f0482d84115e906aa5311f
#
msgid "已有 slab 只需沿当前法向复制时，用 `分层堆叠`；需要从体相按 Miller 面重新定向时用本卡片。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Layer Stack` when an existing slab only needs replication along its "
"current normal. Use this card when a bulk structure must be reoriented "
"and cut by Miller plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:143
#: 0508fc9f5c384a6a860a5ed69160b1f8
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:145
#: 4c7371e59b814ba0b6963b0c630ab84a
msgid "**`(002)` 为什么没有单独输出？** 它与 `(001)` 比例相同，约简后自动去重。相反方向 `(00-1)` 不会合并。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is there no separate output for `(002)`?** It is proportional to "
"`(001)` and is removed after reduction. The opposite orientation `(00-1)`"
" is not merged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:147
#: a802b1eab420401ea1dd3d0dbcf9d4ce
msgid ""
"**重复数为什么不等于看到的原子层数？** 它重复的是 ASE 定向后的体相单元。用输出的实际原子平面与目标性质收敛情况判断 slab "
"厚度，不要把 `r` 当作固定的原子平面计数。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the repeat count differ from the visible number of atomic "
"layers?** It repeats the bulk unit after ASE has oriented it. Judge slab "
"thickness from the actual atomic planes in the output and convergence of "
"the target property; do not treat `r` as a fixed count of atomic planes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:149
#: 21dea91d06eb4f3bafca7a95a1e630fe
msgid "**为什么运行前就提示超限？** 精确输出数或总生成原子数超过安全参数。预览会给出当前数量；缩小晶面/范围，或在确认资源足够后提高对应上限。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is a limit reported before the run starts?** The exact output count"
" or total generated-atom count exceeds a safety limit. The preview shows "
"the current count. Reduce the plane list or scan ranges, or raise the "
"corresponding limit after confirming that sufficient resources are "
"available."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:151
#: f3df90e39d974f3794d5b3c058639b43
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:153
#: 3ea97959e033452294491de643b12eca
msgid "`Slab(hkl=(h,k,l),R=重复数,vac=单侧真空,pz=0|1)`。`pz` 表示表面法向是否周期。"
msgstr ""
"`Slab(hkl=(h,k,l),R=repeat count,vac=one-sided vacuum,pz=0|1)`. `pz` "
"indicates whether the surface normal is periodic."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:155
#: dadeaf3a54b64224b2d4e7b60cfa28dd
msgid "旧配置迁移"
msgstr "Legacy Configuration Migration"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:157
#: 14d1ac81efb24e588044eb45e41fb6ff
msgid ""
"旧版 `h_range/k_range/l_range` "
"会在加载时按旧范围展开，再约简、去重并显示成晶面表格。界面会给出迁移提示，请在运行前核对可见列表；范围步长不再产生超过终点的额外值。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy `h_range/k_range/l_range` values are expanded using the old ranges"
" when loaded, then reduced, deduplicated, and displayed as a plane table."
" The interface shows a migration notice; verify the visible list before "
"running. Range stepping no longer produces an extra value beyond the stop"
" value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:159
#: a5275fa02d2a4a1b81c0597fe8777e21
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:161
#: 23272df4600a4a42b4d5abb38374ea06
msgid "无随机性。输出顺序固定为：晶面表格行 → 法向重复数 → 真空值。"
msgstr ""
"No randomness is involved. Output order is fixed as: plane-table row → "
"normal repeat count → vacuum value."

